              C ${hx + 108} ${hy + 166}, ${hx + 126} ${hy + 124}, ${hx + 112} ${hy + 88}
              C ${hx + 98} ${hy + 54}, ${hx + 70} ${hy + 52}, ${hx + 24} ${hy + 52} Z`}
          fill="#fecaca"
